# Keep line endings LF in the repository and in the working tree, so
# .editorconfig, Prettier (endOfLine: lf) and Git agree on Windows too.
# Without this, a fresh clone checks out CRLF and `npm run format:check` fails.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
